# GitHub logins whose pull requests pass the "Reviewed or maintainer" check
# without a second reviewer (#5607). One login per line; `#` starts a comment.
#
# This is NOT CODEOWNERS and does not grant any repository permission. It only
# says "this author's PRs need no second reviewer to satisfy that check". Every
# other author needs an approving review from someone with write access.
#
# The check reads this file from the BASE branch (the workflow checks out the
# base sha), not from the PR, so a PR cannot add its own author here.
#
